          "feedUrl": "https://anchor.fm/s/118a88194/podcast/rss",
          "description": "Every episode, Hazel picks something from history she’s curious about. Her dad, Caleb, does the research and tells her a fascinating true story. Hazel hears it for the first time during recording, so her questions, surprises, and unexpected detours are completely unscripted.\n\nFrom bizarre events and forgotten places to remarkable people and unlikely discoveries, Derailable explores the strange, surprising, and sometimes unbelievable stories hiding in our past.\n\nA history podcast for curious kids and grown-ups alike.",
